\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"pi-media-collection-tab-content\" id=\"pi-tab-3\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"pi-item pi-media pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sylvanus_Model.png\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Statue\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sylvanus_Model.png\" srcset=\"/w/images/e/e1/Sylvanus_Model.png 1x, /w/images/e/e1/Sylvanus_Model.png 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Statue\" width=\"183\" height=\"380\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Stats</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Deity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Deity\">Deity</a></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Silvanus</b> is the <a href=\"/wiki/God\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"God\">god</a> of nature and wilderness, neutral. He is associated domain Nature.\n<p><br>\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; width: 80px; height: 80px; clip-path: xywh(0 0 100% 100% round 15%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png/80px-Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a4/Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png/120px-Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/a4/Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a4/Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png/80px-Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a4/Book_Tome_Y_Unfaded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Silvanus, god of all that's wild, \n<p>Of nature's danger and its charm. \n</p><p>His glory's not to be defiled, \n</p>\nOr you yourself will come to harm.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/A_is_for_Azuth,_and_other_Gods_XI\" title=\"A is for Azuth, and other Gods XI\">A is for Azuth, and other Gods XI</a></div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Silvanus, known also as the Treefather or Oak Father, presides over nature, specifically wild nature, in both its natural beauty and fierce savagery. He can be wild and unpredictable, much like nature itself, and is wrathful towards those who threaten wild places. He is the patron of <a href=\"/wiki/Druid\" title=\"Druid\">Druids</a>. \n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> is a druid grove dedicated to the Treefather.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Teachings\">Teachings</span></h2>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">A disease of the flower must not reach the root. Pluck the petals. Sever the branch if you must. But cut out the rot before it infects the whole of the wood.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Kagha\" title=\"Kagha\">Kagha</a> shares a teaching of Silvanus</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">To reject the helpless is to reject Silvanus himself.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">A seed nobly sown renders the sweetest fruit.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: left\"><blockquote style=\"font-size: 110%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Nature is the True State of the World.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_items\">Related items</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.